                    revenue_takerate: `Take-rate — a margin on every transaction the platform carries`,
                    revenue_freemium: `Freemium — free tier for reach, paid tiers for the ones who stick`,
                    revenue_project: `Project fees — quoted per job, the way this company has always billed`,
                    r3_cashmodel_label: `When does that money actually arrive?`,
                    cashmodel_slow: `Slowly, compounding — costs land now, revenue builds over eighteen months`,
                    cashmodel_blended: `Blended — a paid pilot cohort funds part of the build as it runs`,
                    cashmodel_frontloaded: `Mostly in year one — the work is quoted, delivered and invoiced inside the period`,
